SetVar *result evaluate(None)

GetTableElement id of API_PARAMS
SetVar *arg_id LASTRESULT

GetTableElement username of API_TOKEN
SetVar *arg_author LASTRESULT

execute app/scripts/db/deleteProject.gcs

SetVar *result evaluate({'msg': 'Project deleted successfully'})

evaluate {*arg_author} + ' deleted the project: ' + {*arg_name} =>*log_text
execute app/scripts/system/writeLog.gcs

end